ice"}],"aras":3}]},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3","nama":"Humans","soalan":[{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.88e396","j":"mcq","s":"The <b>skull</b> protects the ______.","p":["spinal cord","heart and lungs","brain","organs in the lower abdomen"],"a":"brain","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.db1773","j":"mcq","s":"The bones that protect the <b>heart and lungs</b> are ______.","p":["backbone","skull","ribs","pelvic bone"],"a":"ribs","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.172018","j":"mcq","s":"The bones that protect the <b>organs in the lower abdomen</b> are ______.","p":["backbone","skull","pelvic bone","ribs"],"a":"pelvic bone","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.9d825b","j":"mcq","s":"The joint in the <b>shoulder</b> allows ______.","p":["arms can rotate","hands can be moved up and down","legs can be bent","arms can be bent"],"a":"arms can rotate","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.9d9cb4","j":"mcq","s":"The joint in the <b>knee</b> allows ______.","p":["arms can be bent","legs can be bent","hands can be moved up and down","head can turn"],"a":"legs can be bent","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.25170b","j":"mcq","s":"The joint in the <b>wrist</b> allows ______.","p":["head can turn","arms can rotate","hands can be moved up and down","legs can be bent"],"a":"hands can be moved up and down","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.11ce3d","j":"mcq","s":"The adult human skeleton has approximately ______ bone shafts.","p":["100","500","206","50"],"a":"206","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.16dbfa","j":"mcq","s":"For strong bones, we need to drink ______.","p":["carbonated water","milk","syrup","coffee"],"a":"milk","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.cbe569","j":"mcq","s":"Muscles ______ and relax to move bones.","p":["liquid","grow up","broken","shrink"],"a":"shrink","aras":1},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.0b391a","j":"isi","s":"The joint at the <b>elbow</b> allows ______.","bank":["hands can be moved up and down","arms can be bent","arms can rotate","head can turn"],"a":"arms can be bent","aras":2},{"id":"t3-sains-dlp-3.5990